<title>USA: MBIA qualifies four issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies four issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Wednesday it qualified four municipal issues for bond insurance scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Somerville, Mass., $21.4 million general obligation bonds</p>
<p>--Chesterfield, Mo., $14.2 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Las Vegas, Nev., GOs $10.5 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Gananda, N.Y., GOs $1.5 million GOS.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
